      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不仅高尚又优雅──\n还具有足以令所有人着迷的魅力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "af13bcd262fe89f93a1501df059b1539fd17ebc2df8819cc716e343f105b8e88",
