    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1e42383fb8ceeb01b468466",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "认真考究起来，在法国看比赛开始被人们视为\n休闲放松活动的契机，\n正是源自布洛涅林苑建立了赛场──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "46201004773deb7b39d965c6adb19bb04f00990e258412aa3f9d3ffcc565323c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
